{
  "_comment": [
    "Fork-curated catalogue additions, merged on top of the TRvlvr download_checks",
    "and Politrees UVR_resources catalogues by core/extra_catalog.py.",
    "",
    "Kept separate from model_manual_download.json because that file is a cache of",
    "TRvlvr's download_checks.json and is replaced wholesale on every online",
    "refresh; entries added there would disappear as soon as the app went online.",
    "",
    "Schema matches the upstream lists: {selectable label: {local filename: url}}.",
    "For MDX/Roformer/SCNet entries the '.yaml' key is the LOCAL config filename",
    "(saved into mdx_c_configs/) and its value is the remote URL, so several",
    "checkpoints sharing one upstream config.yaml still get distinct local names."
  ],

